    <string name="aod_widgets_appearance_hint" formatted="false">Brightness applies to everything on the always-on display: time, date, notifications, battery information and widgets. Saturation and clarity apply only to widgets; saturation 0% is monochrome and 100% keeps the original colours. High definition makes text clearer and uses more rendering memory. The awake lock screen keeps its original appearance. Save to apply, or go back to discard changes. Actual panel brightness is still controlled by the system always-on display.</string>
